\begin_layout Subsubsection
ImageJ Plugins and Macro Paths
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Bio7 supports plugins and macros for ImageJ. The default folders are:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Bio7/plugins/com.eco.bio7.image_x.x.x/plugins
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
Bio7/plugins/com.eco.bio7.image_x.x.x/macros
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Plugins which are copied into the plugins folder extend the menu 
\series bold
Plugins
\series default
 with submenus. 
\series bold
Plugins > Utilities > Control Panel
\series default
