\begin_layout Subsubsection
Custom OpenGL Code
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Custom OpenGL commands can be written in the Java editor as regular Java code. With the Bio7 wizard a new OpenGL file can be created. Two parameterized methods (
\family typewriter
setup
\family default
, 
\family typewriter
run
\family default
) are created which make the gl (glu, glut) context available to draw custom shapes and develop models in a 3-dimensional space. After the compilation the execution is enabled in the 
\series bold
Time
\series default
 tab of the Options Space view.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Float table
placement H
alignment document
wide false
sideways false
status open

