\begin_layout Standard
The 
\series bold
Texture
\series default
 group displays an image as a textured plane: the active ImageJ image (static, load again after changes, e.g., of the LUT), the active ImageJ image (dynamic, the texture is updated with the image) or an image file. 
\series bold
Flip Vertically
\series default
