\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The 
\series bold
Height Map
\series default
 group displays the pixel values of the active ImageJ image (8-bit, 16-bit, 32-bit, e.g., a digital elevation model or a measurement as a 32-bit image) as the heights of a surface which is textured with the selected texture. 
\series bold
Plot View
\series default
 displays the height map as a surface plot with the axes, the box and the grids of the plot API. 
\series bold
