\begin_layout Standard
With the class 
\family typewriter
PlotTable
\family default
 the data of the Bio7 table can be plotted: 
\family typewriter
PlotTable.select(...)
\family default
 opens a dialog to select the columns of the active sheet (or of the selected cells) for the roles of a plot (e.g., X, Y, Z and an optional group). The dialog contains the settings of the plot, too: the title, the axis titles, logarithmic axes, the color map and the export action. Examples are available in the folder opengl/plotapi/table (the demo data are created with TableDemoData).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Float table
placement H
