name "subsec:Export-Plots"

\end_inset

\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A plot can be exported to an interactive web page (
\family typewriter
exportHtml
\family default
, a single HTML file with WebGL, the plot can be rotated and zoomed in any web browser), to a glTF file (
\family typewriter
exportGltf
\family default
, *.glb) and for Blender (
\family typewriter
exportBlender
\family default
, a *.glb file and a Python script which imports the plot with the texts, a camera and lights in a new scene: in Blender Scripting - Open - Run Script). With 
\family typewriter
exportAction(true)
\family default
 the export action is displayed in the toolbar of the Space view (Export Plot (WebGL, Blender)).
\end_layout

