\begin_layout Standard
In the Measure tab distances, areas and shapes can be measured on the globe. Before a measurement the 
\series bold
Shape
\series default
 (a line, a path, a polygon, a circle, an ellipse, a square or a rectangle), the 
\series bold
Path type
\series default
, the 
\series bold
Units
\series default
 and the 
\series bold
Angle Format
\series default
 can be selected. 
\series bold
Follow terrain
\series default
 includes the heights of the terrain, the 
\series bold
Control points
\series default
, the 
\series bold
Rubber band
\series default
, a 
\series bold
Free Hand
\series default
 selection and the 
\series bold
Tooltip
\series default
 can be enabled. A measurement is started with 
\series bold
New Measur.
\series default
, edited with 
\series bold
Edit
\series default
 and stopped with 
\series bold
