\begin_layout Subsubsection
Plotting
\end_layout

\begin_layout Paragraph
\begin_inset VSpace medskip
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Since Bio7 1.7.1 it is possible to plot single and multiple plots with ImageJ as the default R plot device.
 Multiple plots are displayed in an ImageJ image stack (with the available slider you can select one plot in the stack).
 Plots and plot stacks can be saved as images and movies with ImageJ in different formats (e.g.
 stacks can be stored as *.avi or animated *.gif).
 The size of the plots and the format can be changed in the Rserve Plot Preferences of Bio7 (see 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "subsec:R-Plot-Preferences"
