\begin_layout Subsection
Custom Menus
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Another nice feature of Bio7 is the simple way to extend the Script menus in Bio7 with BeanShell,
 Groovy,
 Jython scripts,
 R scripts and ImageJ macros.
 Bio7 recognizes files dropped to special folders automatically and extends the menus with the filename of the dropped files.
